 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "回到开头的 Aztec Connect。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的 Aztec Connect。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 1.693,
   "speechEnd": 3.577
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "它已经弃用，管理员密钥已经放弃，合约里却仍然有钱。",
   "spoken": "它已经弃用，管理员密钥已经放弃，合约里却仍然有钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 3.98,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 3.98,
   "speechEnd": 9.03
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "证明按 32 笔交易一组校验。",
   "spoken": "证明按 32 笔交易一组较验。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 9.48,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 9.48,
   "speechEnd": 11.947
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "L1 上的结算，只处理到一个字段写的笔数。",
   "spoken": "L1 上的结算，只楚理到一个字段写的笔数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 12.34,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 12.434,
   "speechEnd": 16.503
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "这个字段，没有和证明绑定，由攻击者填写。",
   "spoken": "这个字段，没有和证明绑定，由攻击者填写。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 16.96,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 17.057,
   "speechEnd": 20.603
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "攻击者把它设成 1。伪造的存款不被记账，证明仍然有效。",
   "spoken": "攻击者把它设成 1。伪造的存款不被记账，证明仍然有效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 21.02,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 21.02,
   "speechEnd": 25.971
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "按 rekt.news、SlowMist 和 Halborn 的分析，第一名攻击者取走约 219 万美元，第二名又取走约 8.8 万美元。",
   "spoken": "按 rekt.news、SlowMist 和 Halborn 的分析，第一名攻击者取走约 219 万美元，第二名又取走约 8.8 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 26.44,
   "dur": 10.56,
   "speechStart": 26.533,
   "speechEnd": 36.826
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "安全研究者的结论是，问题在证明和结算之间的绑定。",
   "spoken": "安全研究者的结论是，问题在证明和结算之间的绑定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 37.22,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 37.315,
   "speechEnd": 42.16
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "所以结算要用证明里的全部公开输入。数量、索引、长度，也必须被证明覆盖。",
   "spoken": "所以结算要用证明里的全部公开输入。数量、索引、常度，也必须被证明覆盖。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 42.64,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 42.64,
   "speechEnd": 49.598
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "已经弃用的合约，要么彻底停用，要么继续放在监控和赏金范围里。",
   "spoken": "已经弃用的合约，要么彻底停用，要么继续放在监控和赏金范围里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 49.98,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 50.077,
   "speechEnd": 56.404
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "同样的问题，放大到整条 L2。",
   "spoken": "同样的问题，放大到整条 L2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 56.84,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 56.84,
   "speechEnd": 59.322
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "欺诈证明的 Rollup，假设挑战期里至少有一个诚实的挑战者，提款要等几天。",
   "spoken": "欺诈证明的 Rollup，假设挑战期里至少有一个诚实的挑战者，提款要等几天。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 59.78,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 59.87,
   "speechEnd": 66.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "有效性证明的 Rollup，假设证明系统可靠、电路正确，提款通常几小时。",
   "spoken": "有效性证明的 Rollup，假设证明系统可靠、电路正确，提款通常几小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 66.72,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 66.72,
   "speechEnd": 73.667
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "两种证明系统，都能被运营方切换或暂停，链也能回滚。",
   "spoken": "两种证明系统，都能被运营方切换或暂停，链也能回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 74.14,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 74.234,
   "speechEnd": 79.08
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "2024 年 8 月，OP Mainnet 的故障证明在审计中发现漏洞，守护者把它切回许可模式。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 8 月，OP Mainnet 的故障证明在审计中发现漏洞，守护者把它切回许可模式。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 79.48,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 79.48,
   "speechEnd": 86.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 的证明层发现状态不一致，拒绝出证明，链回滚约 1.5 小时。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 的证明层发现状态不一致，拒绝出证明，链回滚约 1.5 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 87.3,
   "dur": 8.72,
   "speechStart": 87.407,
   "speechEnd": 95.815
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "L2BEAT 的 Stages 框架，按去掉运营方之后剩下多少保障，给 L2 分级。",
   "spoken": "L2BEAT 的 Stages 框架，按去掉运营方之后剩下多少保障，给 L2 分级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep14/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 96.24,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 96.34,
   "speechEnd": 102.632
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "Stage 越低，安全越依赖运营方和多签。",
   "spoken": "Stage 越低，安全越依赖运营方和多签。",
